#: ../../technical/articles/113-external-service-constants-field-provenance-and-filing-producers.md:12
msgid ""
"This chunk contains nine files totaling 2,310 lines, 126,256 bytes, and "
"34,966 measured proxy tokens. I read all seven assigned pages. It "
"centralizes immutable external-service constants, field provenance "
"vocabularies, filesystem change-time and permission helpers, history-"
"discovery signals, and producer identities for filing-export values. This"
" is static analysis only; AEAT portal behavior, Windows ACL behavior, and"
" registry-to-producer coverage were not exercised."
msgstr ""
"Este bloque contiene nueve archivos con un total de 2,310 líneas, 126,256"
" bytes y 34,966 tokens de aproximación medidos. Leí las siete páginas "
"asignadas. Centraliza constantes inmutables de servicios externos, "
"vocabularios de procedencia de campos, funciones auxiliares de hora de "
"cambio y permisos del sistema de archivos, señales de descubrimiento de "
"historial e identidades de productores de valores de exportación de "
"presentaciones. Solo análisis estático; no se ejercitaron el "
"comportamiento del portal AEAT, las ACL de Windows ni la cobertura del "
"registro por productores."

#: ../../technical/articles/113-external-service-constants-field-provenance-and-filing-producers.md:14
msgid "External constants and portal surfaces"
msgstr "Constantes externas y superficies del portal"

#: ../../technical/articles/113-external-service-constants-field-provenance-and-filing-producers.md:16
msgid ""
"`external_constants.py` loads a packaged TOML mirror into strict frozen "
"Pydantic models. It groups AEAT domains, route fragments, Cl@ve "
"selectors, notification filters, portal paths, action-pattern labels, "
"Google OAuth scopes, MIME types, encodings, and language values. Parsing "
"is local and cached; loading does not access storage or call a provider. "
"Main sections are validated on load, and portal path entries must be "
"absolute-path fragments. The volatile Pre303/IVA-wallet section is "
"intentionally staged as raw data and validates into a strict model on "
"first use, so a broken wallet selector does not prevent unrelated "
"commands from reading the registry. external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.toml "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.toml`)"
msgstr ""
"`external_constants.py` carga una copia TOML empaquetada en modelos "
"Pydantic estrictos y congelados. Agrupa dominios AEAT, fragmentos de "
"rutas, selectores Cl@ve, filtros de notificaciones, rutas del portal, "
"etiquetas de patrones de acciones, ámbitos OAuth de Google, tipos MIME, "
"codificaciones y valores de idiomas. El análisis es local y se almacena "
"en caché; cargar no accede al almacenamiento ni llama a un proveedor. Las"
" secciones principales se validan al cargar y las entradas de rutas del "
"portal deben ser fragmentos de rutas absolutas. La sección volátil de "
"Pre303 y monedero IVA se mantiene intencionadamente como datos sin "
"procesar y se valida en un modelo estricto al utilizarse por primera vez,"
" para que un selector roto del monedero no impida a comandos ajenos leer "
"el registro. external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/external_constants.py`) external_constants.py "
